      "line_start": 18,
      "line_end": 18,
      "text": "Alarmed, she yells at Stuart and then throws her gold pouch at him before storming out the door."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0022-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 22,
      "line_end": 22,
      "text": "As the group approaches the preparations happening in the field, they find Stafl singing and directing the workers from a makeshift throne of barrels on the back of a wagon."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0026-03",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 26,
      "line_end": 26,
      "text": "Immediately they can all see the trees pull back and then start to turn to the east, away from the town."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0028-07",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 28,
      "line_end": 28,
      "text": "Lysandra tells her that she can’t remember much after the group left, only that she decided to go around the forest and she could smell meat while trying to sleep."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0028-08",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 28,
      "line_end": 28,
      "text": "She is exhausted and disoriented."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0030-03",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "text": "Thirty minutes later they come across an unusual sight: a wagon partly unloaded and horses wandering around a stack of crates."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0030-06",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "text": "She says it is a tower where the voices are coming from and she knows where it is."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0032-05",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 32,
      "text": "Mixed in with the meat is cleverly disguised tainted meat."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0032-06",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 32,
      "text": "Not being able to separate the good from the bad, the whole thing will have to be burned."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0032-08",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 32,
      "text": "Sara is very concerned about who she can now trust in the city."
    }
  ],
